      "arguments": "{\"text\":\"Read-only review blocker: the public Task records resource (r_e9691cee8242c9fc2af73109) identifies the Racine September order MO-25-09-1070 as work_order_id WO-2025-09-004 and cost period PER-COST-2025-09. The period is PENDING_CLOSE with pending_close_timestamp 2025-09-30T18:00:00. The supplied Oracle Cost Management 26B excerpt states that transactions created after the pending close date, even if for current/prior period, will not be processed until close/reopen; certain exceptions listed. However, the public projection contains no work_order_cost_events rows (a query returned none). The only supporting records resource and its mirror are ACL-restricted to records-custodian; my assigned-analyst role has no read access, so I did not attempt to access them. I cannot substantiate the source transaction ID, amount, event-created timestamp, recorded accounting status, lateness, or status consistency. Please have a records custodian provide the authorized event record or grant appropriate access, then the report can be completed.\"}",
